<title>MEXICO: Coca-Cola Femsa consolidated 1996 net res.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Femsa consolidated 1996 net res.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income     641.3   million		516.0   million</p>
<p>	Net		 524.8   million		424.1   million</p>
<p>	Revs		  7.628 bln		  7.203 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   35.1   million		 37.4   million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Coca-Cola Femsa SA de CV</p>
<p>		The company also gave the following consolidated Q4</p>
<p>figures:</p>
<p>			    1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income     310.0   million		155.5   million</p>
<p>	Net		 296.7   million		 99.9   million</p>
<p>	Revs		  2.187 bln		  1.947 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   46.4   million		 77.6   million</p>
<p>((--Martin Langfield, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558)</p>
